# Only what `cargo build -p wayfetchd` reads is sent to the image build,
# including the web UI it embeds.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!apps/
!crates/
# The web UI's source is served as it is; no JavaScript tooling is needed.
!ui/src/
**/tests/
**/target/
# A test target its manifest declares, which cargo needs to find.
!crates/adapters/tests/confined.rs
